coeurl
------------------------------------------
Simple library to do http requests asynchronously via CURL in C++. (Eventually
as coroutines, once all the compilers I need to support support them.)

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcoeurl-devel-0.3.2-1bl2
  libcoeurl0.3-0.3.2-1bl2
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libevent2.1_7-2.1.13-1
  libfmt12-12.2.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libspdlog-devel-1.17.0-1bl2
  libspdlog1.17-1.17.0-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  doctest-2.5.3-1bl1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libfmt-devel-12.2.1-1bl1
  libspdlog-devel-1.17.0-1bl2
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://nheko.im/nheko-reborn/coeurl

Canonical download:
  https://nheko.im/nheko-reborn/coeurl/-/archive/v0.3.2/coeurl-v0.3.2.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack coeurl-0.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./coeurl-0.3.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/coeurl-0.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/coeurl-0.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcoeurl0.3-0.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcoeurl-devel-0.3.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(coeurl)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/coeurl.README
  /usr/share/doc/coeurl/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/coeurl/README.md

(libcoeurl0.3)
  /usr/bin/cygcoeurl-0.3.dll

(libcoeurl-devel)
  /usr/include/coeurl/client.hpp
  /usr/include/coeurl/errors.hpp
  /usr/include/coeurl/headers.hpp
  /usr/include/coeurl/request.hpp
  /usr/lib/libcoeurl.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/coeurl.pc

